     "text": "is named shop.example."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S03",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 385,
   "to": 478,
   "text": "The internet doesn't speak names. It speaks numbers.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 385,
     "to": 446,
     "text": "The internet doesn't speak names."
    },
    {
     "from": 447,
     "to": 478,
     "text": "It speaks numbers."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S04",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 489,
   "to": 567,
   "text": "Names are for humans. Routing is for machines.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 489,
     "to": 530,
     "text": "Names are for humans."
    },
    {
     "from": 531,
     "to": 567,
     "text": "Routing is for machines."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S05",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 613,
   "to": 758,
   "text": "So in the first millisecond, your browser is holding an envelope with no address on it.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 613,
     "to": 663,
     "text": "So in the first millisecond,"
    },
    {
     "from": 664,
     "to": 696,
     "text": "your browser is holding"
    },
    {
     "from": 697,
     "to": 758,
     "text": "an envelope with no address on it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S06",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 769,
   "to": 873,
   "text": "Before anything can be sent, the name has to become a number.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 769,
     "to": 823,
     "text": "Before anything can be sent,"
    },
    {
     "from": 824,
     "to": 873,
     "text": "the name has to become a number."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S07",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 884,
   "to": 1000,
   "text": "Somebody has to run that translation — every single time you press Enter.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 884,
     "to": 948,
     "text": "Somebody has to run that translation —"
    },
    {
     "from": 949,
     "to": 1000,
     "text": "every single time you press Enter."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S08",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1031,
   "to": 1076,
   "text": "It didn't always work this way.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1031,
     "to": 1076,
     "text": "It didn't always work this way."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S09",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1087,
   "to": 1297,
   "text": "For the internet's first decade, there was one text file, HOSTS.TXT — the whole network's contact list,",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1087,
     "to": 1141,
     "text": "For the internet's first decade,"
    },
    {
     "from": 1142,
     "to": 1240,
     "text": "there was one text file, HOSTS.TXT —"
    },
    {
     "from": 1241,
     "to": 1297,
     "text": "the whole network's contact list,"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S10",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1308,
   "to": 1433,
   "text": "maintained by one office at SRI, updated when you phoned in a change.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1308,
     "to": 1373,
     "text": "maintained by one office at SRI,"
    },
    {
     "from": 1374,
     "to": 1433,
     "text": "updated when you phoned in a change."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S11",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1444,
   "to": 1602,
   "text": "Thousands of hosts, one file, one office, one phone line. That was the ceiling.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1444,
     "to": 1510,
     "text": "Thousands of hosts, one file,"
    },
    {
     "from": 1511,
     "to": 1574,
     "text": "one office, one phone line."
    },
    {
     "from": 1575,
     "to": 1602,
     "text": "That was the ceiling."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S12",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1653,
   "to": 1816,
   "text": "In 1983, Paul Mockapetris proposed a different design: no central book at all.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1653,
     "to": 1721,
     "text": "In 1983, Paul Mockapetris"
    },
    {
     "from": 1722,
     "to": 1778,
     "text": "proposed a different design:"
    },
    {
     "from": 1779,
     "to": 1816,
     "text": "no central book at all."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S13",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1827,
   "to": 1940,
   "text": "A hierarchy, distributed worldwide — the Domain Name System.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1827,
     "to": 1902,
     "text": "A hierarchy, distributed worldwide —"
    },
    {
     "from": 1903,
     "to": 1940,
     "text": "the Domain Name System."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S14",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 1951,
   "to": 2126,
   "text": "The spec we still run today was written in November 1987. It predates the web itself.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1951,
     "to": 1991,
     "text": "The spec we still run today"
    },
    {
     "from": 1992,
     "to": 2078,
     "text": "was written in November 1987."
    },
    {
     "from": 2079,
     "to": 2126,
     "text": "It predates the web itself."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S15",
   "chapter": 1,
   "from": 2137,
   "to": 2210,
   "text": "So how do you look things up in a book that has no center?",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2137,
     "to": 2167,
     "text": "So how do you look things up"
    },
    {
     "from": 2168,
     "to": 2210,
     "text": "in a book that has no center?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S16",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 2281,
   "to": 2509,
   "text": "Your browser doesn't do the walking. It hands the question to a resolver — yours, or a public one like 1.1.1.1.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2281,
     "to": 2337,
     "text": "Your browser doesn't do the walking."
    },
    {
     "from": 2338,
     "to": 2402,
     "text": "It hands the question to a resolver —"
    },
    {
     "from": 2403,
     "to": 2509,
     "text": "yours, or a public one like 1.1.1.1."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S17",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 2520,
   "to": 2628,
   "text": "Think of the resolver as a librarian you've hired to fetch one book.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2520,
     "to": 2577,
     "text": "Think of the resolver as a librarian"
    },
    {
     "from": 2578,
     "to": 2628,
     "text": "you've hired to fetch one book."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S18",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 2639,
   "to": 2726,
   "text": "The librarian starts at the top: the root servers.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2639,
     "to": 2695,
     "text": "The librarian starts at the top:"
    },
    {
     "from": 2696,
     "to": 2726,
     "text": "the root servers."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S19",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 2737,
   "to": 2826,
   "text": "The root doesn't know shop.example. It never will.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2737,
     "to": 2803,
     "text": "The root doesn't know shop.example."
    },
    {
     "from": 2804,
     "to": 2826,
     "text": "It never will."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S20",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 2837,
   "to": 2970,
   "text": "It answers one smaller question: who handles names ending in .example?",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2837,
     "to": 2899,
     "text": "It answers one smaller question:"
    },
    {
     "from": 2900,
     "to": 2970,
     "text": "who handles names ending in .example?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S21",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3001,
   "to": 3117,
   "text": "That's a referral — not the answer, just the address of the next counter.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3001,
     "to": 3034,
     "text": "That's a referral —"
    },
    {
     "from": 3035,
     "to": 3062,
     "text": "not the answer,"
    },
    {
     "from": 3063,
     "to": 3117,
     "text": "just the address of the next counter."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S22",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3128,
   "to": 3218,
   "text": "The next counter is the TLD server for .example.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3128,
     "to": 3182,
     "text": "The next counter is the TLD server"
    },
    {
     "from": 3183,
     "to": 3218,
     "text": "for .example."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S23",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3229,
   "to": 3338,
   "text": "Same move: it points to the shop's authoritative name server.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3229,
     "to": 3290,
     "text": "Same move: it points to the shop's"
    },
    {
     "from": 3291,
     "to": 3338,
     "text": "authoritative name server."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S24",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3349,
   "to": 3554,
   "text": "That server, finally, holds the record: shop.example — 192.0.2.33.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3349,
     "to": 3434,
     "text": "That server, finally, holds the record:"
    },
    {
     "from": 3435,
     "to": 3554,
     "text": "shop.example — 192.0.2.33."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S25",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3565,
   "to": 3681,
   "text": "The answer travels back to your browser. The envelope gets its address.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3565,
     "to": 3631,
     "text": "The answer travels back to your browser."
    },
    {
     "from": 3632,
     "to": 3681,
     "text": "The envelope gets its address."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S26",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3692,
   "to": 3770,
   "text": "Four counters, and none of them knew the whole book.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3692,
     "to": 3735,
     "text": "Four counters, and none of them"
    },
    {
     "from": 3736,
     "to": 3770,
     "text": "knew the whole book."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S27",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3781,
   "to": 3881,
   "text": "The whole walk usually finishes in well under a tenth of a second.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3781,
     "to": 3825,
     "text": "The whole walk usually finishes"
    },
    {
     "from": 3826,
     "to": 3881,
     "text": "in well under a tenth of a second."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S28",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 3927,
   "to": 4025,
   "text": "But if every Enter paid that full price, the root would melt.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 3927,
     "to": 3994,
     "text": "But if every Enter paid that full price,"
    },
    {
     "from": 3995,
     "to": 4025,
     "text": "the root would melt."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S29",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 4036,
   "to": 4137,
   "text": "Most of the time, nobody is actually walking the hallway at all.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4036,
     "to": 4095,
     "text": "Most of the time, nobody is actually"
    },
    {
     "from": 4096,
     "to": 4137,
     "text": "walking the hallway at all."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S30",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 4213,
   "to": 4303,
   "text": "Every answer along the way gets written on a sticky note.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4213,
     "to": 4250,
     "text": "Every answer along the way"
    },
    {
     "from": 4251,
     "to": 4303,
     "text": "gets written on a sticky note."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S31",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 4314,
   "to": 4490,
   "text": "Your browser keeps notes. Your operating system keeps notes. Your resolver keeps the biggest stack.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4314,
     "to": 4362,
     "text": "Your browser keeps notes."
    },
    {
     "from": 4363,
     "to": 4424,
     "text": "Your operating system keeps notes."
    },
    {
     "from": 4425,
     "to": 4490,
     "text": "Your resolver keeps the biggest stack."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S32",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 4501,
   "to": 4656,
   "text": "Next time you ask, the note answers in about a millisecond — faster than a camera shutter.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4501,
     "to": 4536,
     "text": "Next time you ask,"
    },
    {
     "from": 4537,
     "to": 4608,
     "text": "the note answers in about a millisecond —"
    },
    {
     "from": 4609,
     "to": 4656,
     "text": "faster than a camera shutter."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S33",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 4667,
   "to": 4796,
   "text": "Each note carries a TTL — time to live — set by the record's owner.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4667,
     "to": 4725,
     "text": "Each note carries a TTL —"
    },
    {
     "from": 4726,
     "to": 4756,
     "text": "time to live —"
    },
    {
     "from": 4757,
     "to": 4796,
     "text": "set by the record's owner."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S34",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 4807,
   "to": 4936,
   "text": "It's the expiry date on the carton. Fresh until then. Questioned after.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4807,
     "to": 4873,
     "text": "It's the expiry date on the carton."
    },
    {
     "from": 4874,
     "to": 4909,
     "text": "Fresh until then."
    },
    {
     "from": 4910,
     "to": 4936,
     "text": "Questioned after."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S35",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 4982,
   "to": 5098,
   "text": "That's what people call \"DNS propagation\" — but nothing is pushed.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 4982,
     "to": 5014,
     "text": "That's what people call"
    },
    {
     "from": 5015,
     "to": 5098,
     "text": "\"DNS propagation\" — but nothing is pushed."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S36",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 5109,
   "to": 5256,
   "text": "You change the record, and old answers simply sit in caches until their dates pass.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5109,
     "to": 5145,
     "text": "You change the record,"
    },
    {
     "from": 5146,
     "to": 5215,
     "text": "and old answers simply sit in caches"
    },
    {
     "from": 5216,
     "to": 5256,
     "text": "until their dates pass."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S37",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 5267,
   "to": 5388,
   "text": "In 2021, Facebook's nameservers went dark mid-maintenance.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5267,
     "to": 5339,
     "text": "In 2021, Facebook's nameservers"
    },
    {
     "from": 5340,
     "to": 5388,
     "text": "went dark mid-maintenance."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S38",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 5399,
   "to": 5542,
   "text": "For about eleven minutes, the world's caches still served the last correct copies.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5399,
     "to": 5438,
     "text": "For about eleven minutes,"
    },
    {
     "from": 5439,
     "to": 5492,
     "text": "the world's caches still served"
    },
    {
     "from": 5493,
     "to": 5542,
     "text": "the last correct copies."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S39",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 5553,
   "to": 5695,
   "text": "Then they expired — and facebook.com simply stopped being an answer anywhere.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5553,
     "to": 5587,
     "text": "Then they expired —"
    },
    {
     "from": 5588,
     "to": 5640,
     "text": "and facebook.com simply"
    },
    {
     "from": 5641,
     "to": 5695,
     "text": "stopped being an answer anywhere."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S40",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 5706,
   "to": 5943,
   "text": "That is how much of this system runs on sticky notes: 1.1.1.1 alone answers about 1.9 trillion lookups a day.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5706,
     "to": 5748,
     "text": "That is how much of this system"
    },
    {
     "from": 5749,
     "to": 5798,
     "text": "runs on sticky notes:"
    },
    {
     "from": 5799,
     "to": 5864,
     "text": "1.1.1.1 alone answers"
    },
    {
     "from": 5865,
     "to": 5943,
     "text": "about 1.9 trillion lookups a day."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S41",
   "chapter": 3,
   "from": 5989,
   "to": 6148,
   "text": "A phonebook this size, this fast, this uncritical — what could possibly go wrong?",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5989,
     "to": 6062,
     "text": "A phonebook this size, this fast,"
    },
    {
     "from": 6063,
     "to": 6103,
     "text": "this uncritical —"
    },
    {
     "from": 6104,
     "to": 6148,
     "text": "what could possibly go wrong?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S42",
   "chapter": 4,
   "from": 6204,
   "to": 6237,
   "text": "Three honest answers.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 6204,
     "to": 6237,
     "text": "Three honest answers."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S43",
   "chapter": 4,
   "from": 6248,
   "to": 6379,
   "text": "First: the questions themselves were open postcards for 33 years.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 6248,
     "to": 6301,
     "text": "First: the questions themselves"
    },
    {
     "from": 6302,
     "to": 6379,
     "text": "were open postcards for 33 years."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S44",
   "chapter": 4,
   "from": 6390,
   "to": 6573,
   "text": "Classic DNS rides plaintext UDP. Anyone on the path could read every name you looked up.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 6390,
     "to": 6479,
     "text": "Classic DNS rides plaintext UDP."
    },
